                </div>
                <pre class="bg-gar-bg-primary p-4 overflow-x-auto"><code class="text-sm text-gar-text-primary font-mono">{`-- Set garterm as default terminal
gar.set("spawns", {
    terminal = "garterm"
})

-- Keybind to spawn terminal
gar.bind("Super+Return", function()
    gar.spawn("terminal")
end)`}</code></pre>
              </div>

              <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gar-text-primary mb-3">Shared Configuration</h4>
              <p class="text-gar-text-secondary mb-4">
                When garterm starts, it reads the <code class="text-gar-accent-cyan">gar.terminal</code> table from gar's init.lua:
              </p>
              <div class="rounded-lg overflow-hidden border border-gar-text-muted/20 mb-6">
                <pre class="bg-gar-bg-primary p-4 overflow-x-auto"><code class="text-sm text-gar-text-primary font-mono">{`gar.terminal = {
    shell = "/bin/zsh",
    font = { family = "JetBrains Mono", size = 14 },
    colors = { preset = "catppuccin" },
    window = { padding = {12, 12} },
    tab_bar = { position = "bottom" },
}`}</code></pre>
              </div>

              <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gar-text-primary mb-3">Lua Callbacks</h4>
              <p class="text-gar-text-secondary mb-4">
