                </div>
                <pre class="bg-gar-bg-primary p-4 overflow-x-auto"><code class="text-sm text-gar-text-primary font-mono">{`# OSC 133 shell integration
precmd() { printf '\\e]133;A\\a'; }
preexec() { printf '\\e]133;B\\a'; }`}</code></pre>
